1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:03,520
Every time I get some money, I crash my car.

2
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:06,780
Every time I get some money, something in my house breaks.

3
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:07,620
Why?

4
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:10,860
Because our ancestors also carry some of these programs

5
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:13,100
that we inherit in our epigenetic field.

6
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,500
So back in the day, money is the root of all evil.

7
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,540
Anyone with money is bad.

8
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:20,380
Or if I have too much money, I'll grow apart from God.

9
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:22,460
And this person ends up carrying that belief,

10
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:24,300
no matter how hard they hustle,

11
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:26,160
no matter how much effort they put in,

12
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:28,140
no matter how much they know they want money,

13
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:30,100
that they want to be successful.

14
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:33,060
But it's like money just slips right through their fingers

15
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:36,060
because we're always validating our beliefs.

16
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:40,440
And our subconscious makes up 90% of who we are.
